    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "fish skin with a granular texture, esp. shark and stingray",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "刀の柄に巻く鰄は、防水性に優れ、握りやすいとして珍重された。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "日本刀の装飾に使われる鰄は、表面の粗さが特徴である。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "職人は鰄を丹念に磨いて、武器や工芸品に用いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "「かいらぎ」など鑑賞するのはそのためである。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "民藝四十年",
                "author": "柳宗悦",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "rough ceramic glaze (like sharkskin)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "この陶芸家は、鰄という特殊な釉薬を使って、独特の質感を表現している。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "陶板の表面に施された鰄の釉薬は、光の当たり方で色が変わる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "古い焼き物の中には、サメ皮に似た質感の鰄で仕上げられた作品が残っている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
